  "item": [
    {
      "id": "be15c156-e9af-49e2-880a-783f02df8ccd",
      "name": "Corporate Hierarchy Enrich",
      "description": {
        "content": "Use [Corporate Hierarchy Enrich](#585acff6-f231-4109-b818-b2ff586c18d3) to retrieve corporate hierarchy detail using valid query parameters. A Corporate Hierarchy Enrich request requires you to specify both input parameters about the company you are enriching, and the output fields you want to retrieve.\n\nRefer to the examples provided to build a valid JSON request. For supported input and output parameters:\n\n*   Use the [Corporate Hierarchy Enrich Inputs](#d72da288-2069-47c9-b36f-16cdab5d9988) endpoint to retrieve a list of valid input parameters you can provide\n*   Use the [Corporate Hierarchy Enrich Outputs](#d6813026-dcae-4b20-9ee4-b1301451a2c7) endpoint to retrieve a list of valid output fields that can be returned",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
